# Builder-only environment of the `campplus` Dockerfile stage: exports the 3D-Speaker CAM++ ONNX with export_campplus_onnx.py.
# None of this reaches the image; the ONNX is pinned by sha256 in models.lock.json and the stage's output is checked against it.
# CPython 3.13, CPU-only torch. Resolved with campplus_lock.py into campplus-export.lock (hashes for aarch64 and x86_64).
